# Everything an operator fills in or a host renders: a secret, a credential, cert
# material, or a rendered configuration. The tracked half is the template and the
# example beside it, and every script refuses to run rather than defaulting to a
# value it was not given.
aws/env
certs/env
relay.env
acme.env
acme/
turnserver.conf
static-auth-secret
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
